Package: crew.remote
Title: Workers on Other Machines for 'crew' (Unofficial)
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("D.M.", "Kloppenburg", email = "192165061+dm-k1@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An unofficial launcher plugin for 'crew': the controller starts
    no workers but writes the command they must run, and workers started on
    other machines (other computers, other cloud regions) dial in over TLS,
    take tasks and send back results. A small worker program keeps them
    going, and scripts for Amazon Web Services start the machines as spot
    fleets in one or several regions. NOT part of 'crew' and not made,
    reviewed or endorsed by the authors of 'crew' or 'mirai'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/dm-k1/crew.remote
BugReports: https://github.com/dm-k1/crew.remote/issues
